{"id":"wb-6-398","name":"净土寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"净土寺 (应县)","text":"净土寺，位于山西省朔州市应县城内东北角，又称为北寺。净土寺创建于金天会二年（1124年），2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n净土寺最早可以追溯到后唐明宗的宗庙，到金代在此基础之上修建了如今的净土寺，并在明清两朝经历了大规模修缮。净土寺现仅存金代修建的大雄宝殿，并以殿内精美的天花藻井而闻名。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%87%80%E5%9C%9F%E5%AF%BA_(%E5%BA%94%E5%8E%BF)","revisionId":95121295,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95121295","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/140d96e0faa71222cfa475fd.jpg","title":"应县净土寺大雄宝殿.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%BA%94%E5%8E%BF%E5%87%80%E5%9C%9F%E5%AF%BA%E5%A4%A7%E9%9B%84%E5%AE%9D%E6%AE%BF.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/96/%E5%BA%94%E5%8E%BF%E5%87%80%E5%9C%9F%E5%AF%BA%E5%A4%A7%E9%9B%84%E5%AE%9D%E6%AE%BF.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"狼狼君","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","caption":"​应县净土寺大雄宝殿","width":320,"height":213}}